# Failure Path QA Scenario (Private Literal URL Rejection)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/demo-assets/jobs
Request Body:
{
  "brandId": "ulw_qa_demo_assets_brand_id",
  "productUrl": "http://127.0.0.1",
  "style": "clean-product-demo",
  "videoCount": 3,
  "imageCount": 6
}

Response:
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
vary: rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch
content-type: application/json

{"error":"Private or local URLs are forbidden"}
